### ================================
### PRODUCT API
### ================================

### 1. Lấy tất cả sản phẩm
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products
Accept: application/json

### 2. Lấy sản phẩm theo ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Thêm sản phẩm
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ASUS TUF Gaming F15",
  "description": "Laptop gaming ASUS",
  "price": 25000000,
  "quantity": 10,
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/asus-tuf.jpg",
  "categoryId": 1
}

### 4. Cập nhật sản phẩm
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ASUS TUF Gaming F15 Updated",
  "description": "Laptop gaming ASUS phiên bản mới",
  "price": 27000000,
  "quantity": 15,
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/asus-tuf-new.jpg",
  "categoryId": 1
}

### 5. Xóa sản phẩm
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/1